=== Text #7 ===
> Fr[ances] Carolyn Sedberry, 66 of Middleburg, FL passed away Thursday, May 17,[ 2018.] Mrs. Sedberry was born in[ Baton] Rouge,[ LA] to the late Cleavern and Betty Grimball Broussard,[ Jr]. She loved her family with a fiery passion.
Mrs. Sedberry was preceded in death by her[ parents] and brother, Cleavern Broussard, III[.] She is survived by her loving husband, Charles Sedberry, daughter, Betty Irene Sedberry, two grandsons, Charles and Aaron Sedberry, sister, Doris Broussard Michelli, brother, Donald Broussard, many cousins, n[ie]ces, nephews. She is also survived by several whom she saw[ as] and claimed as daughters, sons, and[ grandchildren.] She[ will] be dearly missed[.
Funeral Services will be held] 11[:]00 AM Tuesday, May 22, 2018[ in the] Chapel of Russell[ Haven] of Rest[ Funeral] Home[ with] Rev.[ Ralph] Estevez offic[iating.] Bur[ial will follow in] Russell[ Haven] of[ Rest Cemetery. Visitation with the family will be from] 5-7:00 PM Monday[ at the funeral home.]

